=== H11 cost model (SYNTHETIC token-equivalents, TE) ===
unit: 1 TE = one prompt token at the reference (pi = 1, mid-price) generator.  completion token = r_out TE (default 4, swept 1/2/4/8).
agent price pi_a multiplies BOTH prompt and completion tokens of that agent's calls. Verifier: its own token counts; v_scale sweeps its price.
encoder/retrieval compute: lam_ms TE per ms. Default 0.0046 TE/ms: a $0.05/vCPU-hour host (1.39e-8 $/ms) against a $3/Mtok prompt price (3e-6 $/TE).
   ms inputs: encode 2.6 ms/text (python ONNX MiniLM, results/f6_py_latency.json; 2.4 ms in results/h1_embed_ident.json), scan 0.02-0.05 ms,
              compute-once memo: encoder calls/decision 3.64 -> 0.98 (cap 4) -> 0.39 (cap 4096) in the repeat-heavy f5/f6 worlds (results/h1_embed_ident.json; not re-measured here).
   lam sweep: 0.0046 (cloud CPU) / 0.1 (accelerator-priced) / 1 / 10 (pathological). rerank: kappa TE per candidate pair (0 here: no rerank arm; g16/h2 rejected rerank).
   pc_disc: multiplier on the static base prompt (prompt-cache style, 1 = none). ctx_scale: multiplier on injected-context tokens.

--- world P (g18 copy, multi-step pipeline) token assumptions ---
  generator step call: prompt 500 + 60/dependency (+ 120 per injected note x gamma), completion 350  => S_REF = 1900 TE at pi = 1, r_out = 4
  verifier call: cv x S_REF TE (cv = .3 default; .8 lat-pricever; 1.0 ctl-rare-pricever): 40 completion tokens + (cv*S_REF - 4*40) prompt tokens
  retrieval: 2.6 ms encode + 0.02 ms scan per step (compute-once: encode only on the first sight of a (project, step type) key)
--- world D (document QA on g16 fixtures) token assumptions ---
  generator call: prompt 300 + injected docs (real chars/4 tokens x ctx_scale 4 = ~297 TE per doc), completion 250 => S_REF_D = 1300 TE at pi = 1 (no context)
  verifier call: 250 prompt + the same evidence docs + 40 completion; cached-answer reverify costs one verifier call
  agent prices (pi): 0.25, 0.25, 1, 1, 3, 3 with caps .50/.50/.68/.68/.86/.86 (synthetic); P prices: Cap = clamp(.25 + 2.5 (mean competence - .4), .25, 3) [also Rand, Flat sensitivity]

--- worked example: pipe-main, always-verify session L3 (mean per task, seeds 31-40) ---
  q 0.771; per task: 5.19 generator calls, 5.19 verifier calls, 4.52 retrievals (4.25 injected notes), 11.8 ms encoder
    gen base prompt          1989.7 TE   19.3%
    gen injected ctx          396.3 TE    3.8%
    gen completion           4975.1 TE   48.2%
    verifier                 2958.0 TE   28.7%
    retrieval/encoder ms        0.1 TE    0.0%
    rerank+tools                0.0 TE    0.0%
    TOTAL                   10319.1 TE
  measured Rust decision-loop CPU (router + gates + bookkeeping): 15.1 us/task (noisy box) = 0.00007 TE at lam 0.0046 -> 6.74e-9 of the task cost

--- break-even prices for the minor components (pipe-main L3) ---
  lam_ms  0.0046: encoder compute = 0.001% of the task cost; with compute-once 0.000%
  lam_ms     0.1: encoder compute = 0.011% of the task cost; with compute-once 0.000%
  lam_ms       1: encoder compute = 0.115% of the task cost; with compute-once 0.002%
  lam_ms      10: encoder compute = 1.135% of the task cost; with compute-once 0.015%
  lam_ms     100: encoder compute = 10.297% of the task cost; with compute-once 0.155%
  => encoder compute reaches 1% of the L3 task cost only at lam_ms ~ 8.8 TE/ms (~1913x the cloud-CPU price); at the default it is 0.0005%
  prompt-cache base x0.1: total 8528 TE (-17.4%); verifier x0.25: 8101 TE (-21.5%); r_out=8: 16124 TE (+56.3%); r_out=1: 5965 TE (-42.2%)

--- price scenarios used by the sensitivity tables (world P / world D) ---
  P  default                            r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  r_out=1 (flat in/out)              r_out 1 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  r_out=2                            r_out 2 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  r_out=8                            r_out 8 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  lam_ms=0.1 (GPU-priced encoder)    r_out 4 lam_ms 0.1 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  lam_ms=1                           r_out 4 lam_ms 1 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  lam_ms=10 (pathological)           r_out 4 lam_ms 10 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  prompt-cache base x0.1             r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 0.1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  ctx x1 (short docs/notes)          r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  ctx x4 (longer notes)              r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  P  verifier x0.25 (cheap model)       r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 0.25 embed_once false
  P  verifier x2                        r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 2 embed_once false
  P  embed compute-once                 r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once true
  D  default                            r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  r_out=1 (flat in/out)              r_out 1 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  r_out=2                            r_out 2 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  r_out=8                            r_out 8 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  lam_ms=0.1 (GPU-priced encoder)    r_out 4 lam_ms 0.1 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  lam_ms=1                           r_out 4 lam_ms 1 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  lam_ms=10 (pathological)           r_out 4 lam_ms 10 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  prompt-cache base x0.1             r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 0.1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  ctx x1 (short docs/notes)          r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 1 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  ctx x8 (long docs)                 r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 8 v_scale 1 embed_once false
  D  verifier x0.25 (cheap model)       r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 0.25 embed_once false
  D  verifier x2                        r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 2 embed_once false
  D  embed compute-once                 r_out 4 lam_ms 0.0046 pc_disc 1 ctx_scale 4 v_scale 1 embed_once true
